  "translations": {
    "translations": [
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://www.wwe.com/shows/wrestlemania/sunday",
          "overview": "The Undisputed WWE Universal Championship will be on the line when Roman Reigns defends his title against the winner of the 2024 Royal Rumble, Cody Rhodes. The Scottish Warrior Drew McIntyre will finally get his chance to win a world title in front of the masses as he faces World Heavyweight Champion Seth \"Freakin\" Rollins at The Showcase of the Immortals. Plus a big tag team match on night 1 where Cody Rhodes and World Heavyweight Champion Seth \"Freakin\" Rollins will go head to head with Dwayne \"The Rock\" Johnson and Undisputed WWE Universal Champion Roman Reigns in a match with huge WrestleMania implications. Bayley is hellbent on seizing the WWE Women's Champion when she goes to war against her former ally IYO SKY at WrestleMania. 'Mami' Rhea Ripley defends her Women's World Title against 'The Man' Becky Lynch in what should be a legendary championship fight and many more.",
          "runtime": 221,
          "tagline": "Biggest Wrestlemania Of All Time",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CN",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "由士力架和《WWE 2K24》联合为您呈现的第四十届WrestleMania将于东部时间4月6-7日晚7点(北京时间4月7-8日早7点，垫场秀于5点开始)在宾夕法尼亚州费城市的林肯金融球场(Lincoln Financial Field)举行！  赛事主题曲:  “Gasoline” by The Weeknd  WWE环球冠军赛(主战赛):  Roman Reigns (c) vs. Cody Rhodes  注：本场比赛规则由前一日主赛结果决定：  若The Bloodline获胜，那么本场比赛将是“血亲规则”；  若Cody Rhodes & Seth \"Freakin\" Rollins获胜，那么本场比赛所有血亲家族成员将禁止出现在擂台边  WWE女子冠军赛:  Iyo Sky (c) vs. Bayley  美国冠军三重威胁赛:  Kevin Owens vs. Logan Paul (c) vs. Randy Orton  世界重量级冠军赛:  Seth \"Freakin\" Rollins (c) vs. Drew McIntyre  单打赛:  LA Knight vs. AJ Styles  费城街头赛:  The Pride (Bobby Lashley, Angelo Dawkins & Montez Ford)vs. The Final Testament (Karrion Kross, Akam & Rezar)",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "WWE 摔角狂热 40 第二赛日"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "FR",
        "iso_639_1": "fr",
        "name": "Français",
        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "La 40e édition annuelle de WrestleMania se déroulera en deux soirées les 6 et 7 avril 2024 au Lincoln Financial Field à Philadelphie, en Pennsylvanie. C'est le deuxième WrestleMania à se tenir à la fois dans la ville de Philadelphie et dans l'État de Pennsylvanie, après WrestleMania XV en 1999.",
          "runtime": 222,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "WWE WrestleMania 40 (Night 2)"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "DE",
        "iso_639_1": "de",
        "name": "Deutsch",
        "english_name": "German",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Am 06. und 07. April 2024 fand zum 40. Mal der WWE-PPV Wrestlemania statt. Austragungort war das in Lincoln Financial Field Philadelphia, Pennsylvania.  Match Card:  WWE World Heavyweight Title Match: Seth Rollins (c) gegen Drew McIntyre // Six Man Tag Team Philadelphia Street Fight (Special Referee: Bubba Ray Dudley): The Pride (Angelo Dawkins, Bobby Lashley & Montez Ford) gegen The Final Testament (Akam, Karrion Kross & Rezar) // AJ Styles gegen LA Knight // WWE United States Title Triple Threat Match: Logan Paul (c) gegen Randy Orton gegen Kevin Owens // WWE Women's Title Match: IYO SKY (c) gegen Bayley // WWE Title / WWE Universal Title Match: Roman Reigns (c) gegen Cody Rhodes",
          "runtime": 225,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "WWE WrestleMania XL - Sonntag"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CZ",
        "iso_639_1": "cs",
        "name": "Český",
        "english_name": "Czech",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "WrestleMania XL pokračuje ve Filadelfii. Cody Rhodes vyzve nesporného univerzálního šampiona WWE Romana Reignse.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "IT",
        "iso_639_1": "it",
        "name": "Italiano",
        "english_name": "Italian",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "L'Undisputed WWE Universal Championship sarà in palio quando Roman Reigns difenderà il suo titolo contro il vincitore del Royal Rumble 2024, Cody Rhodes. Lo Scottish Warrior Drew McIntyre avrà finalmente la possibilità di vincere un titolo mondiale di fronte alle masse mentre affronterà il World Heavyweight Champion Seth \"Freakin\" Rollins allo Showcase of the Immortals. Inoltre, un grande tag team match nella prima serata in cui Cody Rhodes e il World Heavyweight Champion Seth \"Freakin\" Rollins si scontreranno testa a testa con Dwayne \"The Rock\" Johnson e l'Undisputed WWE Universal Champion Roman Reigns in un match con enormi implicazioni per WrestleMania.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "KR",
        "iso_639_1": "ko",
        "name": "한국어/조선말",
